; One variable: the [hr] tag. add_hr (rich_text_label.cpp:4159-4199) pushes a paragraph item, so the
; text before the rule ends its line, then draws the 2 x 2 white horizontal_rule icon at the given
; width, height, colour and alignment. The text after the tag joins the rule's line (measured in
; Godot 4.6.3). No other scene authors an [hr].

